{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":39769,\"title\":\"Hawaiian Ecstasy\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"When Tatiana, a beautiful language student from Moscow, arrives in Hawaii, she has no idea of the astounding adventure and erotic mayhem her presence will unleash. Lonely and frustrated, Tatiana finds an ancient statue of a Hawaiian god buried in the sand, not knowing that it carries an old curse and has terrible powers...\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ofmgfVNOGljbLkrbnqZtpaUxR6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qH0jSBqa4xIwmhNsGFVr7Qhm9uE.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":4,\"year\":1997,\"runtime\":91,\"genres\":[],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Frank Thring\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":234765,\"name\":\"Frank Thring\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xexLu28NzwTwN8dGqXK2SqCA8aK.jpg\"},{\"id\":136058,\"name\":\"Missy\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8DBtULHRdqnffcy5C2k0Qcf2d5C.jpg\"},{\"id\":109689,\"name\":\"Silvia Saint\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iwh0GmY7NZ29mujyAnNtnp7Gmpb.jpg\"},{\"id\":534848,\"name\":\"Brooke Ashley\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Tqa7FDvmMM8l0TIfw7fZyS4s9y.jpg\"},{\"id\":1148643,\"name\":\"Nastasy\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n67tZ6UTizchxTo5ZQRs2rW1e77.jpg\"},{\"id\":1461875,\"name\":\"Lana Sands\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fCTtlK1mbKl1vRGf2SpW7nZVAEj.jpg\"},{\"id\":1461881,\"name\":\"Mishi\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/98dRYIZ3q5j3ACW3QkibJAR50l7.jpg\"},{\"id\":1729844,\"name\":\"Kimi Gee\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8D7dbSKDbSNIv6tUNkzs3aVlBwv.jpg\"},{\"id\":2182907,\"name\":\"Lennox\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qyilr72ZTVRBlO5OcRV4c9Q4YZu.jpg\"},{\"id\":234775,\"name\":\"Frank Gun\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8fA0Bns74u3LxmIsZJs01IDuJ8O.jpg\"},{\"id\":135072,\"name\":\"David Perry\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qdp4fBybksYMVVKSQAxwyRreX3m.jpg\"},{\"id\":999473,\"name\":\"Guy DiSilva\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/peANHjBVZDecQS5SNOphnXjEiQ7.jpg\"},{\"id\":234765,\"name\":\"Frank Thring\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xexLu28NzwTwN8dGqXK2SqCA8aK.jpg\"},{\"id\":995439,\"name\":\"Mickey G.\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oUlXzabgCoYERWz1ONyPuIdgURV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1148651,\"name\":\"Sean Rider\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wscCib6pEg8XyuPN87l8FUfJQEl.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":460195,\"title\":\"Hoʻomau\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7aITXDcnPLnP8EHVJ5zfW39gPVa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zyE1VgLmnmLv4PCMhPGduG0gq6j.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fictional story of ancient Hawai‘i anchored in Hawaiian values, Ho'omau is the story of Lehua, a young woman of mixed ancestry, who must persist against perilous odds to defend all she holds dear when war breaks out between tribes of different origin in ancient Hawai'i.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9870,\"title\":\"Forgetting Sarah Marshall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d4elOzyhNWVlxpG7BwigrumkFTe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xe0kqei6uS5qzcSEb2bmokld0YN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When actress Sarah Marshall dumps aspiring musician Peter Bretter for rock star Aldous Snow, Peter's world comes crashing down. His best friend Brian suggests that Peter should get away from everything and to fly off to Hawaii to escape all his problems. After arriving in Hawaii and meeting the beautiful receptionist Rachel Jansen, Peter is shocked to see not only Aldous in Hawaii, but also Sarah.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12403,\"title\":\"A Perfect Getaway\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ncuGG0hIlA03dQBJmdoT2LWgodG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wQE7BCTo9sdGEG5hywmC0hz8NoZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For their honeymoon, newlyweds Cliff and Cydney head to the tropical islands of Hawaii. While journeying through the paradisaical countryside the couple encounters Kale and Cleo, two disgruntled hitchhikers and Nick and Gina, two wild but well-meaning spirits who help guide them through the lush jungles. The picturesque waterfalls and scenic mountainsides quickly give way to terror when Cliff and Cydney learn of a grisly murder that occurred nearby and realize that they're being followed by chance acquaintances that suspiciously fit the description of the killers.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270648,\"title\":\"Kumu Hina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aMoAYO3fW8QQmnC8Guik9xdYZ4M.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A powerful film about the struggle to maintain Pacific Islander culture and values within the Westernized society of modern day Hawaiʻi. It is told through the lens of an extraordinary Native Hawaiian who is both a proud and confident māhū, or transgender woman, and an honored and respected kumu, or teacher, cultural practitioner, and community leader.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12634,\"title\":\"The Big Bounce\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l6tzLXXGubnC6TbFgg8acfcvGRO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3ERk0cT9GIfxv6ULs2XZV3wgvEU.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A small-time con artist and a Hawaiian real estate developer's mischievous, enterprising mistress team up for a potential $200,000 score.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10104,\"title\":\"Dorm Daze 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6H4osjA6mFDBPMRKHkuoDrF4sXm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/igVGnlYpHXg9Z0UZDuCegOpSVKn.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The gang from Dorm Daze is back, but this time they're on a cruise ship on a tropical voyage through the high seas. The cruise makes an educational stop at the island of San Paradiso, where the students are supposed to explore an important archaeological site. Things go from normal to crazy as their visit coincides with every other college's spring break. The moment the boat docks, classes are over! For these Billingsley students, their Semester at Sea will be an adventure no one will ever forget.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":851814,\"title\":\"World's Biggest Great White?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/18euQ4TXmRWTL7ubFtwy888Z7vx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bVBBEAu916Alu6GDyT1D4DGNkzo.jpg\",\"rating\":4.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three great whites are spotted in the waters off Oahu, but another one could be lurking just below the surface.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1235800,\"title\":\"The Birth of Korea\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pZnBWGtCM0qJ1ktMlszFDmmrw9j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/29eSDqQoezhjFbtpkVk7ejh5umb.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Since South and North Korea's liberation in 1945, North Korea, a communist dictatorship that suppresses freedom and oppresses human rights, and South Korea, which has entered the path of economic prosperity and advanced countries based on freedom and democracy, have taken different paths. How did the two countries with the same language, history, and race, become divided into two extreme countries? A work that highlights the sacrifices and struggles of President Syngman Rhee and the first generation of founding members who worked to create and protect today's Republic of Korea over the past 70 years of history.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844341,\"title\":\"There Will Be Glitter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f6ttdmd70t7aRbSdcmJ5zRi7XpJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iRZUFWmKZjffRuQuUNzXuaL8R5a.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A story about the GLBTQ community at Gettysburg College: students and faculty, past and present. Enjoy a glimpse of their lives as they discuss everything from Coming Out to Dorm Drama to gBurg's RED HOT dating scene.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":466846,\"title\":\"Campus Diary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ZMiakqV6Ut3sZXj6dRnqS6RHgo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ryKCEJTeNo72Ewf2DNEAgPwiV1A.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Nikhil, a student who joins a college for his post graduate course. Being a guy with a modern personality, Nikhil wants to bring about social changes. As part of an NSS camp, he goes to a village where some interesting events happen and this is what the movie revolves around.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"IH9QzLASLNk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Vbvh3RsOkRc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"xmFD3iSEto4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}",